{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2023-01-19 14:30:00', 'title': 'J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'LOWELL, ARK.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. (NASDAQ:JBHT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $ 0.42 (FORTY TWO CENTS) PER COMMON SHARE, WHICH IS A 5% INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEBRUARY 10, 2023 AND WILL BE PAID ON FEBRUARY 24, 2023.'}